### 1. Create Bill Group
POST http://localhost:4110/api/groups
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Trip Bandung",
  "participants": [
    {
      "name": "Alice"
    },
    {
      "name": "Bob"
    },
    {
      "name": "Charlie"
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Get Group Details
GET http://localhost:4110/api/groups/1

### 3. Add Expense
POST http://localhost:4110/api/groups/1/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Dinner",
  "amount": 300000.00,
  "paidByParticipantId": 1,
  "participantIds": [1, 2, 3]
}

### 4. Add Another Expense
POST http://localhost:4110/api/groups/1/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Taxi",
  "amount": 90000.00,
  "paidByParticipantId": 2,
  "participantIds": [2, 3]
}

### 5. Get Expenses
GET http://localhost:4110/api/groups/1/expenses

### 6. Get Settlement
GET http://localhost:4110/api/groups/1/settlement
